  "new": "<!-- where (v6): where you live, where you want to work, cities, remote. Step 1 of 2 before the paywall -->\n<section class=\"scr\" data-scr=\"where\">\n  <div class=\"back\" data-go=\"welcome\"><i class=\"ti ti-arrow-left\"></i></div>\n  <div class=\"setup\"><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:60%\" data-ob6bar></i></div><div class=\"lab\"><span data-ob6step=\"where\">Step 1 of 2</span><b data-ob6pct>60%</b></div></div>\n  <div class=\"body nonav\">\n    <div class=\"lenschip\"><i class=\"ti ti-bulb\"></i><div><b>Smart Defaults + Goal-Gradient.</b> <span data-t=\"ob6LensWhere\"></span></div></div>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" data-t=\"ob6WhH\">Where do you want to work?</h2>\n    <p class=\"mut mt6\" data-t=\"ob6WhSub\">We start from your CV and where you are. Add any country you would move to.</p>\n    <div id=\"ob6Where\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cta\"><div class=\"ob6meta\" id=\"ob6WhMeta\"></div><button class=\"btn btn-b\" id=\"ob6WhCta\" data-go=\"targets\"><span data-t=\"ob6Continue\">Continue</span></button></div>\n</section>\n<!-- targets (v6: roles only; cities moved to where, employer types and Auto-Apply mode to tune) -->\n<section class=\"scr\" data-scr=\"targets\">\n  <div class=\"back\" data-go=\"where\"><i class=\"ti ti-arrow-left\"></i></div>\n  <div class=\"setup\"><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:80%\" data-ob6bar></i></div><div class=\"lab\"><span data-ob6step=\"targets\">Step 2 of 2</span><b data-ob6pct>80%</b></div></div>\n  <div class=\"body nonav\">\n    <div class=\"lenschip\"><i class=\"ti ti-bulb\"></i><div><b>Smart Defaults.</b> <span data-t=\"ob6LensTargets\"></span></div></div>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" data-t=\"tH\">Confirm your targets</h2>\n    <p class=\"mut mt6\" data-t=\"tSub\">Pulled from your CV. Change anything that does not fit.</p>\n    <div class=\"setcard\">\n      <div class=\"setcard-h\">\n        <span class=\"setcard-ic\"><i class=\"ti ti-briefcase\"></i></span>\n        <div class=\"setcard-ht\"><span class=\"setcard-t\" data-t=\"tRole\">Target roles</span><span class=\"setcard-n\"><b class=\"selcount\">4</b></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <hr class=\"setcard-div\">\n      <div class=\"chipgrid\">\n        <div class=\"rolechips\" id=\"roleChips_t\">\n          <span class=\"rolechip primary\"><span class=\"rlab\" data-t=\"rFA\">Financial Analyst</span><span class=\"fromcv sm\" data-t=\"fromcvS\">CV</span><button class=\"rx\" aria-label=\"Remove\"><i class=\"ti ti-x\"></i></button></span>\n          <span class=\"rolechip\"><span class=\"rlab\" data-t=\"rSFA\">Senior Financial Analyst</span><button class=\"rx\" aria-label=\"Remove\"><i class=\"ti ti-x\"></i></button></span>\n          <span class=\"rolechip\"><span class=\"rlab\" data-t=\"rFPA\">FP&A Analyst</span><button class=\"rx\" aria-label=\"Remove\"><i class=\"ti ti-x\"></i></button></span>\n          <span class=\"rolechip\"><span class=\"rlab\" data-t=\"rFM\">Finance Manager</span><button class=\"rx\" aria-label=\"Remove\"><i class=\"ti ti-x\"></i></button></span>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"addrole\" data-addrole=\"roleChips_t\"><i class=\"ti ti-plus\"></i> <span data-t=\"rAdd\">Add role</span></button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cta\"><button class=\"btn btn-b\" data-go=\"wall\"><span data-t=\"ob6TgCta\">See my matches</span> <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\"></i></button></div>\n</section>",
